@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Cloudflare Agents runtime
+
+Canonical relationships cover only statically proved, directly bound `AIChatAgent` classes and closed request shapes. `SupportAgent` has an open runtime tools map, `StepSupportAgent` can replace instructions through `prepareStep`, and `DelegatingSupportAgent` uses an ordinary function tool rather than a handoff.
+
+The Worker deployment owner must export each deployed agent class, declare its Cloudflare Durable Object binding, include each new class in a tagged `new_sqlite_classes` migration, wire the provider binding needed to resolve the configured model, route requests to the agents, and deploy the Worker. This repository contains no Worker entrypoint or deployment configuration, so binding names, provider wiring, migrations, routes, and deployed classes are not established here.
